  {
    "key": "C'est le Balloon",
    "value": [
      {
        "templateID": "5",
        "data": {
          "images": [],
          "texts": [
            "A balloon... and your soul. A game of balance... and reflection.\r\n\r\nSometimes? Games don’t need a beginning and an end."
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "templateID": "1",
        "data": {
          "images": [
            "/projects/C'est le Balloon/project-details/2/image5.gif"
          ],
          "texts": []
        }
      },
      {
        "templateID": "5",
        "data": {
          "images": [],
          "texts": [
            "\"We created a peaceful interactive experience that offers calming visuals and minimalistic gameplay. The game emphasizes the importance of the player’s thoughts and feelings as a big part of how the game is experienced. In that regard, we succeeded in our mission with C’est la balloon\""
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "templateID": "1",
        "data": {
          "images": [
            "/projects/C'est le Balloon/project-details/4/balloon_game.gif"
          ],
          "texts": []
        }
      },
      {
        "templateID": "1",
        "data": {
          "images": [
            "/projects/C'est le Balloon/project-details/5/balloon_unity.png"
          ],
          "texts": []
        }
      },
      {
        "templateID": "5",
        "data": {
          "images": [],
          "texts": [
            "Made in Unity. I made all the art, and coded the game.\r\n\r\nOur professor's favorite game was \"Mountain.\" Yes, the game where you stare at a mountain. I found this to be funny, and decided to make him something that was right up his alley.\r\n\r\nI did not make the audio effects or shaders for this game. \r\n\r\nTechnically there was a team, but nobody actually did anything. I just did it all and assigned different aspects to different people so we would all get a good grade."
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
